#%RAML 1.0 DataType
(annotations.package): Session
type: SessionRequest
description: |
  Refreshes the sealed commercetools token behind an existing session. Requires a valid session token as bearer.
  Refresh a few minutes before expiry. The previous token keeps working until it expires, so in-flight requests don't fail.
  After the session token expires, this grant returns `401` and you must mint a new session; a signed-in shopper must sign in again.
discriminatorValue: refresh
